900 C1$="David spoke.":C2$="Andrew spoke.":C3$="Martin spoke.":C4$="Alan spoke.":C5$="Susanna spoke.":C6$="Richard spoke."
1000 GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 6100:BM$="The plane arrived at the Heathrow Airport in London.":GOSUB 5100
1010 BM$="Once they were done with the customs, David and his friends witnessed\something they would have never thought possible before they first left\for their tour.":GOSUB 5100
1020 BM$="Inside their waiting room there were countless TV cameras and\journalists, ready to interview them.":GOSUB 5100
1030 GOSUB 6110:BM$="Once they finally stepped out of the waiting room, a deafening cheer\broke out.":GOSUB 5100
1035 BM$="Their path was filled with young people holding Eleno Vision banners and\magazines with the band on the cover.":GOSUB 5100
1040 BM$="The band barely had the space to even wave at their fans. Before long,\they were surrounded by the police, who escorted them to their car.":GOSUB 5100
1050 GOSUB 6120:BM$="A police car opened the way as they headed towards the Hilton Hotel.\However, rather than relaxing in the lobby, Susanna led them inside the\elevator and then to their room.":GOSUB 5100
