1300 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: Man, I wasn't expecting such a warm reception. They welcomed us\like heroes! It's a shame they had to take us away like criminals though.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: I was told about it, but I definitely underestimated your\popularity!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: It's like a dream come true. I think of it as the price of fame.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I'd like to go to Marquee, but I don't want to bother the owner.":GOSUB 5100
1340 BM$="The Marquee Club was the music venue where Eleno Vision made their\debut. While it did not have any seats, it had a bar, and could house around\400 guests. The band would still go there to relax from time to time.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: Same here... It should be fine if we sneak there, though. I say we all\go together at closing hours.\I was going to be the first to report back to you when I got home... but if we":GOSUB 5100:BM$="sneak there, there won't be a ruckus. Let's all go together just before\closing time.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1360 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: I won't be joining you guys. Before you go, keep this in mind:\you're not the same people you were before the tour. Be careful out\there, alright?":GOSUB 5100
1370 BM$="Right then, someone knocked on the door. It was Richard, the president of\their record label.":GOSUB 5100
