1600 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Richard: Good work, boys. Eleno Vision CDs are selling faster than we can\print them, and we have a pile of requests for your appearances. I don't\remember what sleep is anymore.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: You can deal with the CD situation however you like, but don't go\crazy with those requests. You promised us a two-week vacation after\the tour.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Richard: I know, I know. You'll have your vacation. But be prepared for\schedule hell once you're back!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1630 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Send my paycheck to the bank upfront, boss. No point in a vacation\without money to spend.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1640 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Richard: Way ahead of you. It's not all of it, but you could muck about for an\entire year with it.":GOSUB 5100
1645 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: A year worth of money, but we only get a couple of weeks off...":GOSUB 5100
1650 GOSUB 6370:BM$="Richard: Welcome to life. Of course, Susanna's getting a bonus check too.\Oh, look at the time. Let's go Susanna, we have a meeting.":GOSUB 5100
1660 COMMON FO:BM$="Richard and Susanna left the room.":GOSUB 5100
1670 GOSUB 9020:GOSUB 6180:BM$="Meanwhile, back at their detective agency, Clark was using a typewriter\while conversing with Vince.":GOSUB 5100
